  "body_html": "<p>Bring the vibrant beauty of the desert into your home with this stunning Jeminise quilt set, featuring a lively cactus and floral print. This bedding set adds a touch of nature-inspired elegance and a cheerful pop of color, perfect for refreshing your bedroom decor.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Vibrant Cactus &amp; Floral Design:</strong> Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, ideal for a nature-themed room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customization Options:</strong> Personalize your quilt set by selecting from various sizes, adding pillowcases, or including your name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> A unique and thoughtful gift for cactus lovers or anyone appreciating vibrant home decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made with a breathable soft fabric outer layer and high-quality silk floss filling for comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable for convenient cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, or throw blanket, suitable for all seasons.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Style #1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Cactus, Flowers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Cactus, Desert</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Southwestern Style</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (91\"x102\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
